{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12130","headline":"东陵药堂寄张道士 · 钱起","name":"东陵药堂寄张道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木落苍山空，当轩秋水色。\n清旦振衣坐，永吟意何极。\n愿言金丹寿，一假鸾凤翼。\n日夕开真经，言忘心更默。\n玄都有仙子，采药早相识。\n烟霞难再期，焚香空叹息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}